{
  "area": "traversal",
  "file": "traversal/save",
  "description": "The traversal save block (src/traversal/traversal-save.ts; extensions.traversal): the block a save writes, what a reader accepts or refuses (every unreadable member named in ascending order), and what the decision layers hold after a load.",
